WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:14.400
Yo what’s good? This week we
maskin’ up with Watchmen by Alan Moore and Dave Gibbons

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:22.720
Da year is 1985 and LL cool J ain’t
da only thing bout to blow up: Da beef between

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:28.210
Russia and da US has gotten so tense dat nukes
might start flyin any second. But dem Ruskies

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:33.019
gonna think twice befo’ they make a move,
cuz da US got a viagra-lookin’ super thug

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:38.480
named Dr. Manhattan on their side who can
control thangs on goddamn MOLECULAR level,

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.690
meanin he can be multiple places at once,
teleport, turn Washingtons in to Benjamims-

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:48.829
this brutha can do almost anything!
Manhattan is one of a whole crew of badasses

00:00:48.829 --> 00:00:53.629
dat used to protect da city back when. Cept
these days, people don’t want nobody callin

00:00:53.629 --> 00:00:58.030
da shots but da po-lice, so all dem playas
runnin’ round in their undies gotta put

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:02.510
their hustle to the side. But a stone cold
G named Rorschach don’t give a DAMN bout

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:05.950
dat and still be rockin a mask to patrol da
mean streets.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:09.740
When Rorschach hear that somebody
tossed da Comedian, one of da OG superheros,

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:15.360
out a damn window, he figger somebody might
be tryna ice old costumes one by one. So he

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:20.390
hollas at all da other retired masks- the
gadget slangin Night Owl, da super sexy Silk

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:25.679
Spectre who shacked up wit Doc Manhattan now,
and Ozymandias- the smartest, and RICHEST,

00:01:25.679 --> 00:01:29.380
homie in da world.
Papa Smurf Manhattan decide to go on a lame-ass

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:32.679
talk show when some
dude start runnin his mouth sayin’ dat chillin

00:01:32.679 --> 00:01:38.330
wit his big blue ass causes cancer! Word?
Da news gets the Doc all riled up and he decide

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:43.429
dat dealin wit these loud-ass piles o’ molecules
jus’ ain’t worth a sh** and bounces out

00:01:43.429 --> 00:01:46.479
to Mars.
Now dat Mr. Clean outta da picture, da Russians

00:01:46.479 --> 00:01:50.520
like “haaaell yeah” And
start flexin’. Lata’ an assassin try to

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:55.700
kill Ozymandias, but he jus shakes dat hater
off. Rorschach gets played, whooped by the

00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:00.620
fuzz, and holed up in the big house. If it
wasn’t clear already, Rorschach was right:

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:04.820
somebody IS tryna mess wit deez heros.
So Silk Spectre and Night Owl take

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:10.539
a break from fu**ing, suit up, and bust Rorschach
outta jail. Later, Doc Manhattan scoops up

00:02:10.539 --> 00:02:15.209
Silk Spectre and takes her to Mars so they
can chop it up. Silky axe the Doc to come

00:02:15.209 --> 00:02:19.140
back to Earth and stop da world from ending,
but the Doc don’t really give two sh**s

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:23.310
bout savin’ humanity cuz it ain’t make
no difference to da universe. But after Silk

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:28.099
Spectre chews his ass out, the doc finally
snaps out of it, and decide he gonna return

00:02:28.099 --> 00:02:30.969
back to earth.
Eventually Rorshach and da Owl

00:02:30.969 --> 00:02:36.129
realize dat it might be Ozymandias who mastermindin’
all dis mess. As they swang over to his winter

00:02:36.129 --> 00:02:41.700
pad and say “yo Ozy, dafuq man?” Ozy like
yo- here’s the deal: Da whole world is rotten

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.920
to the core, and gonna tear itself to sh**
unless somebody step up and do somethin’

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.000
bout it. I got a plan.
I’m gonna kill a sh** ton of

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.920
people, blame it on a giant alien- squid dat
I pulled outta my ass, and then errybody will

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:59.390
be on the same side. Naw mean?” They all
like “Yeaaahhhh.... fu** dat. We gonna stop

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:04.200
you.” But Ozy like “too late it already
happened 35 minutes ago.” Oh sh**.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.030
And jus’ like brutha thought,
errybody put they difference aside and unite.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:13.439
Ozy like “I did it! Everlasting peace. How
you like me now son?!” But Manhattan jus’

00:03:13.439 --> 00:03:17.620
like “Baby nothin’ lasts forever.”
Rorshach try to bounce and tattle

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:22.239
on Ozymandias, but Doc Manhattan tell him
he best not cuz at this point, da truth can

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:27.020
only hurt. Rorschach ain’t backin down so
the Doc just turns his ass in to mush.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:31.560
One thing Ozymandias didn’t plan on
though, was at Rorscach got his whole scheme

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:35.879
written down in a journal, which now chillin
at the office of a journalist. Does the world

00:03:35.879 --> 00:03:40.909
learn dat they were saved by a lie? Or does
Ozzie’s new world order keep on truckin?

00:03:40.909 --> 00:03:42.950
Good question, yo...

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:51.000
This sh** right here is so dank dat it made
it into Time Magazine’s top 100 novels eva’

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.779
written. And it sho as hell deserve it- cuz
Watchmen is

00:03:53.779 --> 00:03:55.349
complex as hell.

00:03:55.349 --> 00:03:58.249
First off, Dis graphic novel don’t
read like most.

00:03:58.249 --> 00:04:01.950
We always trippin’ back and forth
through time, switchin’ perspectives, and

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:06.230
readin parts of made up books, letters, and
notes at da end of erry chapter. To readers

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:11.319
used to cruisin’ through stories held together
by cause and effect, Watchmen was a good ol

00:04:11.319 --> 00:04:15.689
fashioned mind-fu**. Not only do dis messy
story-tellin represent da clusterfu** of a

00:04:15.689 --> 00:04:21.190
world dis book take place in, and our own,
but it also mirror da way Doc Manhattan see

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.090
time:

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:37.170
Throughout dis book people geekin
out tryna say Doc Manhattan’s existence

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:41.760
gone and changed da whole world fo’eva,
cuz now Gods walkin’ amongst regular erryday

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:46.700
hoods. But da crazy thing is dat it ain’t
somebody wit super powers dat come to define

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:51.880
da world. Naw baby, the fight for humanity’s
soul is between two superhumans, wit’ emphasis

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:56.780
on da “human” part: Ozymandias and Rorschach.
Ozymandias massacred half of New

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:01.310
York city fo the GREATER good, but Rorsach
jus’ say you shouldn’t kill innocent people

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:06.200
STRAIGHT UP and even give his life tryin to
spread the truth. Do the ends justify the

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.660
means? What’s mo important? The saving lie?
Or the Truth?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:13.810
To Rorschach, errything is black
and white- jus’ like his mask. No grey.

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:19.280
Like he say: some bruthas is good, some bruthas
is bad, and the bad ones gonna get what’s

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.730
comin to em.
Also, His mask always changin

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:26.200
shapes like a true blue rorschach test and
symbolize da way he see da world:

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:44.910
Ozymandias’s name come from Rameses
II, da pharoah of Egypt who was runnin’

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:49.380
da game durin’ da 13th century BC. Percy
Shelley wrote a dope poem bout dat hustla,

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.580
and Watchemen’s 11th chapter even ends wit
a quote from it:

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:02.200
So yeah, on one level it’s just
Ozymandias thinkin he high balla’- dude’s

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:06.610
whack-ass plan to save humanity from itself,
and him actually pullin it off, make him look

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:10.970
like he deserve mo’ props than anybody else.
But if you take a closer peep at Shelley’s

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:15.490
poem, you’ll see it ain’t jus bout talkin
up da ultimate badass- it showin dat even

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:20.520
though it seems like Rameses II got da world
sold up, ain’t nobody legit enough to dodge

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.830
the all destructive power of time.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:34.050
It don’t matter how legit you get
in life- you and what you leave behind ain’t

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:37.590
gonna be around forever. Doc Manhattan even
drop dat same truth:

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:49.060
So is it worth holdin back da
horrible truth fo’ even a little bit of

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:54.120
peace? Or is da truth mo’ important? A question
like dat is maybe jus’ too crazy to answer.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:58.070
Maybe when we faced with horrors like
dat, we only got one option: try to put a

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:00.400
smile on dat face, and laugh about it.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:04.600
Yo if you liked philosophizin’ bout
truth and da greater good, take a couple mo’

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:09.070
minutes and check out my eps on The Brothers
Karamazov and The Grand Inquisitor. I promise,

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:13.690
it’s all some real tight sh**. Thanks fo’
checkin me out. I’ll see y’all next time.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:14.190
Peace.

